    "detailed_description": "&quot;Xianzong Lu&quot; is a simulation and cultivation sandbox game. Players assume the role of the sect master of a cultivation sect, starting from scratch to create their own sect, exploring various secret realms and the world of cultivation. Recruit princesses from the immortal realm, holy maidens, snake queen, prominent saints, and empresses as disciples. Experience the authentic and exciting plot of cultivation novels and engage in thrilling battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Sect</h2>Construct various sect buildings, manage disciples, and cultivate farms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Disciples</h2>Regularly, mortal disciples will come to your sect seeking to join. Travel through the world, make friends, and bring them back to your sect.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Secret Realm Dungeons</h2>Engage in battles in the &quot;meat pigeon&quot; mode, freely combining martial techniques and secret arts for exhilarating combat.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Xianzong Lu&quot; is a simulation and cultivation sandbox game. Players assume the role of the sect master of a cultivation sect, starting from scratch to create their own sect, exploring various secret realms and the world of cultivation. Recruit princesses from the immortal realm, holy maidens, snake queen, prominent saints, and empresses as disciples. Experience the authentic and exciting plot of cultivation novels and engage in thrilling battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Sect</h2>Construct various sect buildings, manage disciples, and cultivate farms.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recruit Disciples</h2>Regularly, mortal disciples will come to your sect seeking to join. Travel through the world, make friends, and bring them back to your sect.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Secret Realm Dungeons</h2>Engage in battles in the &quot;meat pigeon&quot; mode, freely combining martial techniques and secret arts for exhilarating combat.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Xianzong Lu&quot; is a fairy repair, sandbox, pigeon, business simulation role-playing game, players need to start from 0 to create your Zong door, experience the original Xiuxian novel Shuang Wen plot and the lively meat pigeon brush treasure battle.",
